+kcompressd
+=========
+
+Maximum number of locked anonymous folios queued per node for asynchronous
+swapout by kswapd. The default is 24 and the maximum is 256. Set this to 0
+to keep new writes on the normal swap path. Queued work still drains. Offload is
+available with zswap or a swap device advertising efficient synchronous writes.
+
+
 laptop_mode
 ===========
 
